+    - **Step Size Adaptation:**
+        - If $N_{missed} > 0$ (inside cloud): Set $\Delta t = S_{fine}$ [S3, unofficial].
+        - If $N_{missed} \le 0$ (outside cloud): Set $\Delta t = S_{coarse}$ [S3, unofficial].
