+    - **Early Termination:**
+        - If $1.0 - T > 0.95$ (transmittance is very low), break the loop [S2, unofficial].
+    - **Advance Position:**
+        - $t \leftarrow t + \Delta t$ [S2, unofficial].
+
+4.  **Post-Processing:**
+    - **Gamma Correction:** Apply gamma 2.2 to $C$: $C \leftarrow C^{1/2.2}$ [S2, unofficial].
